{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_013dtWKGCy6K6JYVTGAffUqA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted results for each planned experiment in the experiment plan, under the \"best\" tier scenario. I need to provide specific metric values, rationales, and analysis for each experiment.\n\nLet me carefully go through each experiment and generate realistic \"best case\" predictions based on the defined best tier parameters.\n\nKey constraints from the best tier:\n- calibration_mae_pp: [0.8, 2.0]\n- coverage_95_pct: [90, 97]\n\n\n- coverage_80_pct: [75, 85]\n- ci_width_sft_pp: [2.0, 4.0]\n- ci_width_rl_pp: [5.0, 10.0]\n- kendall_tau: [0.92, 0.99]\n- gamma_rel_bias: [0.03, 0.08]\n- signal_auc_sft_rrf: [0.78, 0.92]\n- signal_auc_rl_best_single: [0.62, 0.75]\n- baselines_significantly_beaten: [6, 7]\n- dose_response_monotonic: True\n- multi_family_mae_gap_pp: [0.0, 1.0]\n\nAll the core assumptions check out. Now I'm working through what each experiment should produce. The controlled SFT injection experiment tests whether contamination scales predictably with dosage across different model sizes and random seeds, with paraphrasing helping evade detection. The signal pipeline experiment validates that all four detection methods perform well on contaminated models. The RRF aggregation ablation shows whether combining signals via reciprocal rank fusion reaches the target AUC threshold. I'm continuing through the remaining experiments to map out their expected outcomes.\n\nThe simulation identifiability sweep across 144 conditions should cleanly identify the contamination parameter with confidence intervals that exclude zero, backed by Fisher Information bounds. The noise propagation analysis tests whether the measurement error model achieves proper coverage. The core calibration experiment is the centerpiece—aiming for sub-2pp MAE while outperforming all baseline methods. I'm validating that this calibration holds at the 7B scale, checking signal robustness across different training regimes where Self-Critique should survive better than other signals, and finally confirming the approach generalizes across multiple model families.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12672,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12672},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bda79b13-dcb4-43f9-84c9-2136dd5f87f5","uuid":"bf6c83dd-1e5b-4747-b338-1780dc5f42b7"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_013dtWKGCy6K6JYVTGAffUqA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始framing完全成立。ContamCal作为\"statistical safety net\"在SFT和RL regime下均可靠工作。\n  三条claims无需调整：(1)校准claim以全部4 benchmark × 3 scale × 2 family的显著MAE改进支撑，\n  (2)信号生存claim以清晰的signal×regime AUC heatmap和cliff-like degradation定量支撑，\n  (3)identifiability claim以Fisher Information理论界 + 144条件仿真 + 实际数据一致性三重验证。\n  Headline: \"ContamCal recovers true performance within <2pp MAE with near-nominal CI coverage,\n  while naive scores overestimate by 8-15pp.\" DCR和所有其他baseline被显著beat。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: controlled_sft_injection\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B × 5 dosage levels (0%/5%/25%/50%/100%) × 3 seeds = 45 SFT runs。\n      72B-Instruct生成paraphrases，BLEU<0.3 + cosine>0.85确保evade n-gram同时保留语义污染。\n    expected_results:\n      mmlu_inflation_0pct_pp: 0.0\n      mmlu_inflation_5pct_pp: 1.8\n      mmlu_inflation_25pct_pp: 5.2\n      mmlu_inflation_50pct_pp: 9.1\n      mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp: 14.3\n      gsm8k_inflation_100pct_pp: 11.7\n      arc_inflation_100pct_pp: 12.4\n      humaneval_inflation_100pct_pp: 8.9\n      paraphrase_cosine_similarity_mean: 0.89\n      paraphrase_bleu_mean: 0.22\n      ngram_decontam_evasion_rate_pct: 97.3\n      inflation_std_across_seeds_pp: 0.6\n      scale_effect_3b_vs_0_5b_ratio: 1.15\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下contamination injection完全按预期工作。MMLU作为knowledge-intensive MC benchmark\n      对paraphrase污染最敏感，100% dosage产生~14pp inflation，与\"Rethinking Benchmark and\n      Contamination\"报告的8-15pp范围上端一致。inflation随dosage严格单调递增——5%仅1.8pp因为\n      只有~700/14000 items被污染，而100%覆盖全部items产生最大效应。GSM8K和ARC略低因为\n      reasoning benchmarks的contamination效应更依赖solution memorization而非答案记忆。\n      HumanEval最低(8.9pp)因为N=164且代码生成的paraphrase更难保留原始test case语义。\n      跨seed std仅0.6pp表明injection pipeline高度可复现。3B模型inflation比0.5B略高(1.15×)\n      因为更大模型有更强的memorization capacity，但差异不大因为SFT均使用相同epoch数。\n      paraphrase质量指标全部达标：cosine>0.85确保语义等价，BLEU<0.3确保lexical divergence，\n      97.3% evasion rate验证n-gram decontamination确实无效。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: Contamination Inflation (pp) by Benchmark × Dosage × Scale\"\n        description: >\n          15行(3 scale × 5 dosage) × 4列(benchmarks)矩阵，每cell为mean±std across 3 seeds。\n          展示inflation严格随dosage单调增长，scale效应存在但secondary。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1a: Dose-response curves (dosage% vs inflation pp) per benchmark,分panel by model scale，含error bars。展示严格单调性。\"\n      - \"Fig 1b: Paraphrase quality scatter plot (cosine similarity vs BLEU) for 200 sampled pairs，展示high-semantic-low-lexical zone。\"\n    analysis: >\n      injection pipeline的成功是整个ContamCal validation的基础。best档下所有4 benchmarks\n      在所有dosage levels产生statistically significant inflation (5%的p<0.05, 25%+的p<0.001)，\n      为exp-006的ground-truth calibration评估提供了clean/contaminated pairs。\n      跨scale一致性(std<1pp)意味着calibration结论不受model scale confounding。\n\n  - name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      对exp-001全部45个contaminated+clean模型计算4个detection signals的per-item exposure scores。\n    expected_results:\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_100pct: 0.88\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_25pct: 0.82\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_5pct: 0.71\n      minkpp_auc_sft_100pct: 0.84\n      minkpp_auc_sft_25pct: 0.76\n      minkpp_auc_sft_5pct: 0.64\n      constat_auc_sft_100pct: 0.81\n      constat_auc_sft_25pct: 0.74\n      constat_auc_sft_5pct: 0.62\n      self_critique_auc_sft_100pct: 0.77\n      self_critique_auc_sft_25pct: 0.70\n      self_critique_auc_sft_5pct: 0.59\n      signal_rank_correlation_across_scales: 0.91\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下所有4个signals在SFT regime表现良好。embedding retrieval最强(AUC=0.88 at 100%)\n      因为SFT直接改变了model对contaminated items的internal representation，semantic retrieval\n      能直接捕捉training data与test item的embedding proximity。Min-K%++次之(0.84)因为SFT\n      显著改变了contaminated items的token-level likelihood分布。ConStat(0.81)通过original\n      vs paraphrased performance gap检测，在paraphrase质量高时信号清晰。Self-Critique最低\n      (0.77)因为它依赖model的meta-cognitive ability来报告自身对数据的familiarity，在小模型\n      (0.5B)上meta-cognition较弱。所有signals的AUC随dosage下降因为低dosage下被污染items\n      比例小，signal-to-noise ratio降低。5% dosage时最弱signal(Self-Critique)降至0.59，\n      接近identifiability边界但仍above chance。跨scale rank correlation 0.91表明signal\n      ranking在不同model sizes间稳定——这对实践者选择signal组合很重要。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: Per-Signal AUC by Dosage × Scale\"\n        description: >\n          4 signals × 5 dosages × 3 scales的完整AUC矩阵。展示signal hierarchy和dosage敏感性。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2: Signal AUC heatmap (signal × dosage)，averaged across scales。颜色从deep blue(0.5)到deep red(0.9)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      4个signals提供了互补的contamination detection视角。embedding和Min-K%++依赖model internals\n      (logits/embeddings)，AUC最高但require open weights。ConStat和Self-Critique仅需\n      behavioral access，AUC较低但applicable to closed-weight models。这个hierarchy在best档下\n      清晰且一致，为exp-003的RRF aggregation和exp-013的2-signal degraded mode提供了基础。\n\n  - name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      RRF fusion of 4 signals + ablations: RRF vs rank averaging, single-signal, calibration-weighted,\n      FP injection robustness, 2-signal degraded mode。\n    expected_results:\n      rrf_composite_auc_sft_100pct: 0.92\n      rrf_composite_auc_sft_25pct: 0.85\n      rrf_composite_auc_sft_5pct: 0.78\n      rank_avg_auc_sft_100pct: 0.89\n      best_single_signal_auc_sft_100pct: 0.88\n      calibration_weighted_rrf_auc_sft_100pct: 0.91\n      rrf_auc_at_10pct_fp_injection: 0.89\n      rrf_auc_at_20pct_fp_injection: 0.85\n      two_signal_mode_auc_sft_100pct: 0.83\n      rrf_vs_best_single_delta: 0.04\n      rrf_vs_rank_avg_delta: 0.03\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下RRF composite AUC达0.92(SFT 100%)，显著高于best single signal(0.88, Δ=0.04)，\n      验证了multi-signal fusion的价值。RRF优于rank averaging(Δ=0.03)因为RRF的reciprocal rank\n      weighting自然downweights disagreeing signals，对noisy signals更robust。calibration-weighted\n      variant(0.91)反而略低于standard RRF(0.92)——这支持了meta-circularity argument：\n      learned weights依赖contamination labels来训练，而这些labels本身可能被污染，引入circular\n      dependency。Standard RRF作为parameter-free method避免了这个问题。这是论文中\"RRF is a\n      principled design choice, not contribution\"的定量支撑。FP injection at 10%/20%仅使AUC\n      下降0.03/0.07，展示了RRF对individual signal noise的robustness。2-signal mode(ConStat\n      + Self-Critique)AUC=0.83，比4-signal低0.09但仍well above identifiability threshold(0.70)，\n      为closed-weight scenario提供了viable fallback。5% dosage时composite AUC=0.78，恰好在\n      best档要求的signal_auc_sft_rrf [0.78, 0.92]下界。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: Aggregation Method Comparison\"\n        description: >\n          Rows: RRF, rank-avg, cal-weighted, 4×single-signal, 2-signal mode。\n          Columns: AUC at 5%/25%/50%/100% dosage。含bootstrap 95% CI。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3a: Ablation bar chart showing composite AUC by aggregation method at 100% dosage。\"\n      - \"Fig 3b: FP injection robustness curve (FP rate vs composite AUC decline)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      RRF的优势在best档下清晰但not dramatic(Δ=0.03-0.04 over alternatives)。\n      关键insight不是RRF比alternatives好多少，而是calibration-weighted variant不比RRF好——\n      这定量支撑了anti-meta-circularity论点。论文应强调RRF是principled default而非\n      performance-maximizing choice。2-signal mode AUC=0.83为Claim 2的closed-weight\n      extensibility提供了evidence。\n\n  - name: simulation_identifiability_sweep\n    plan_id: exp-004\n    description: >\n      144-condition simulation sweep: AUC(6) × N_models(4) × prior(3) × exposure_type(2)，\n      10 seeds each。含Fisher Information analysis和Growing Pains pre-estimation。\n    expected_results:\n      gamma_recovery_rmse_auc070_n50: 0.09\n      gamma_recovery_rmse_auc080_n50: 0.06\n      gamma_recovery_rmse_auc055_n50: 0.21\n      gamma_ci_excludes_zero_rate_auc070_n50_pct: 94\n      gamma_ci_excludes_zero_rate_auc060_n50_pct: 72\n      gamma_ci_excludes_zero_rate_auc055_n50_pct: 48\n      theta_gamma_posterior_corr_auc070: -0.18\n      theta_gamma_posterior_corr_auc090: -0.07\n      coverage_95_auc070_n50_pct: 93\n      coverage_80_auc070_n50_pct: 82\n      coverage_95_auc055_n20_pct: 78\n      fisher_info_gamma_threshold_auc: 0.68\n      fisher_info_n_models_threshold: 35\n      growing_pains_improvement_n20_rmse_delta: -0.04\n      prior_sensitivity_rmse_range_at_n50: 0.02\n      gamma_rel_bias_auc070_n50: 0.05\n      gamma_rel_bias_auc080_n50: 0.03\n      practical_identifiability_boundary_auc: 0.65\n      structural_identifiability_boundary_auc: 0.58\n      convergence_rate_pct_all_conditions: 98.6\n      mmlu_gamma_k_ci_excludes_zero: true\n      gsm8k_gamma_k_ci_excludes_zero: true\n      arc_gamma_k_ci_excludes_zero: true\n      humaneval_gamma_k_ci_excludes_zero: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下identifiability结果全面积极。核心发现：AUC≥0.70时γ recovery RMSE=0.09，\n      CI excludes zero in 94% of runs——这确立了practical identifiability threshold。\n      Fisher Information analysis提供了解析基础：I(γ) ∝ N_models × AUC²/(1-AUC²)，\n      当AUC=0.68时Fisher Information跨越了practical identifiability门槛(对应γ的\n      expected CI width < 0.3)。这与empirical threshold(~0.70)高度一致，构成了理论-实证\n      双重验证。structural identifiability boundary更低(AUC=0.58)——参数在数学上unique\n      但estimation precision不足以支撑决策。这个distinction(structural vs practical)是\n      论文的理论贡献之一。\n\n      θ-γ posterior correlation在AUC=0.70时为-0.18——轻微负相关因为contamination inflation\n      和true ability有inherent trade-off，但不足以造成identifiability问题。AUC=0.90时\n      correlation降至-0.07因为更精确的exposure signal使θ和γ更好分离。\n\n      coverage在AUC≥0.70/N≥50时达93%(95% CI)和82%(80% CI)，均在best档nominal范围内。\n      AUC=0.55/N=20时coverage仅78%——这是\"cannot distinguish\"zone，论文需明确标注。\n\n      prior sensitivity在N≥50时很小(RMSE range仅0.02 across 3 priors)——数据dominant\n      prior。N=20时prior matters more，Growing Pains pre-estimation在此regime提供RMSE\n      improvement of 0.04——meaningful but不改变qualitative conclusions。\n\n      per-benchmark γ_k在所有4 benchmarks上CI exclude zero(含HumanEval N=164)——这是\n      best档的关键假设。HumanEval能convergence因为(1) 4PL的contamination效应γ_k不需要\n      per-item estimation精度，(2) 164 items在4PL下仍sufficient for γ的population-level\n      estimation，(3) measurement error model将item-level noise上推到γ_k的posterior width\n      而非bias。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 4: γ Recovery RMSE × Coverage Matrix (AUC × N_models)\"\n        description: >\n          6×4 matrix, cells含RMSE和95% coverage。Heat-colored by identifiability quality。\n          Clear boundary line at AUC≈0.68, N≈35。\n      - name: \"Table 5: Fisher Information Analytical vs Empirical Thresholds\"\n        description: >\n          Side-by-side comparison of I(γ)-derived thresholds and simulation-observed boundaries。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4a: Identifiability phase diagram (AUC × N_models plane)，colored by γ CI-excludes-zero rate。Sharp transition at AUC≈0.68。\"\n      - \"Fig 4b: Fisher Information I(γ) as function of AUC，with horizontal line at practical threshold。Analytical curve overlaid with simulation points。\"\n      - \"Fig 4c: Prior sensitivity fan chart at N=20 vs N=50 vs N=200。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文Claim 3的核心支撑。Fisher Information analysis将empirical threshold提升为\n      theoretically grounded result——reviewer可以verify the math而非仅rely on simulation。\n      structural vs practical identifiability distinction直接回应\"θ and γ identifiable?\"\n      reviewer concern。144 conditions的completeness使结论robust to cherry-picking accusation。\n      per-benchmark γ_k全部converge(含HumanEval)意味着论文可以confidently report per-benchmark\n      results而非仅global γ。\n\n  - name: noise_propagation_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      (A) Measurement error model: exposure_ij ~ N(τ_ij, σ_e²)，propagate Stage 1 uncertainty。\n      (B) Post-hoc noise injection at 1×/1.5×/2× levels。\n    expected_results:\n      coverage_95_point_estimate_pct: 83\n      coverage_95_measurement_error_model_pct: 93\n      coverage_80_point_estimate_pct: 69\n      coverage_80_measurement_error_model_pct: 81\n      coverage_50_measurement_error_model_pct: 52\n      ci_width_sft_point_estimate_pp: 1.8\n      ci_width_sft_measurement_error_pp: 3.1\n      ci_width_rl_measurement_error_pp: 7.2\n      gamma_bias_point_estimate: 0.04\n      gamma_bias_measurement_error: 0.05\n      noise_injection_1x_coverage_95_pct: 86\n      noise_injection_1_5x_coverage_95_pct: 89\n      noise_injection_2x_coverage_95_pct: 93\n      sigma_e_estimated_sft: 0.12\n      sigma_e_estimated_rl: 0.28\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下measurement error model成功将coverage从sub-nominal(83% at 95% level)提升到\n      near-nominal(93%)。机制清晰：point-estimate exposure将Stage 1的estimation error\n      \"frozen\"进IRT fitting，导致posterior underestimates uncertainty。Measurement error model\n      通过latent τ layer自动将σ_e uncertainty propagate到γ和θ的posteriors中。\n\n      coverage gap在point-estimate baseline下约12pp(83% vs 95% nominal)——这正是MVP中\n      观察到的gap来源。measurement error model闭合了大部分gap(93% vs 95%)，剩余2pp gap\n      来自local independence violation(single model responses correlated)和4PL model\n      misspecification(真实item characteristics并非exactly 4PL)。\n\n      CI width从1.8pp(point-estimate)增至3.1pp(measurement error, SFT)——这是\"honest\n      uncertainty\"的代价。RL regime下CI更宽(7.2pp)因为σ_e更大(0.28 vs 0.12)——RL\n      post-training使detection signals更noisy，measurement error model正确reflect这一点。\n      这直接支撑了论文的\"wide CIs are the correct answer\"framing。\n\n      γ bias几乎不变(0.04→0.05)——measurement error model主要影响precision(CI width)\n      而非accuracy(point estimate)。这是desirable property：不牺牲accuracy来换coverage。\n\n      post-hoc noise injection(Part B)展示了清晰的coverage-noise relationship：\n      at 2× noise level coverage恢复到93%，与measurement error model一致。\n      这提供了independent validation——两种不同方法得到相同的coverage correction。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6: Coverage Comparison — Point Estimate vs Measurement Error Model\"\n        description: >\n          Rows: 50%/80%/95% nominal levels × {point-estimate, measurement-error, post-hoc 1×/1.5×/2×}。\n          Columns: SFT regime, RL regime。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 5a: Coverage calibration plot (nominal level vs actual coverage)。Diagonal=perfect。Point-estimate below diagonal, measurement error model on diagonal。\"\n      - \"Fig 5b: CI width distribution (violin plot) for SFT vs RL regime under measurement error model。RL clearly wider。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Measurement error model是ContamCal的architectural必要组件而非optional enhancement。\n      没有它coverage为83%——reviewer会rightfully question credible intervals的reliability。\n      SFT/RL regime下σ_e的2.3×差异(0.12 vs 0.28)提供了regime-aware uncertainty的自动机制，\n      无需手动adjust priors。这是Claim 3(uncertainty quantification)的核心technical支撑。\n\n  - name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      4PL+γ IRT(global和per-benchmark γ_k两个variants)在exp-001 controlled data上fitting，\n      与7个baselines对比，5个metrics评估。\n    expected_results:\n      # Per-benchmark γ_k model (PRIMARY)\n      calibration_mae_mmlu_pp: 1.2\n      calibration_mae_gsm8k_pp: 1.5\n      calibration_mae_arc_pp: 1.4\n      calibration_mae_humaneval_pp: 1.9\n      calibration_mae_avg_pp: 1.5\n      coverage_95_pct: 93\n      coverage_80_pct: 81\n      coverage_50_pct: 52\n      ci_width_sft_avg_pp: 3.1\n      kendall_tau: 0.96\n      dose_response_monotonic: true\n      dose_response_r_squared: 0.97\n      # Global γ model (ABLATION)\n      global_gamma_mae_avg_pp: 2.1\n      global_gamma_coverage_95_pct: 88\n      # Per-benchmark γ_k values\n      gamma_k_mmlu: 0.42\n      gamma_k_gsm8k: 0.35\n      gamma_k_arc: 0.38\n      gamma_k_humaneval: 0.28\n      gamma_k_mmlu_ci: \"[0.31, 0.54]\"\n      gamma_k_gsm8k_ci: \"[0.22, 0.49]\"\n      gamma_k_arc_ci: \"[0.25, 0.52]\"\n      gamma_k_humaneval_ci: \"[0.11, 0.47]\"\n      # Baselines\n      raw_mae_avg_pp: 11.2\n      remove_rescore_mae_avg_pp: 6.8\n      single_signal_2pl_mae_avg_pp: 3.9\n      vanilla_4pl_mae_avg_pp: 8.4\n      linear_regression_mae_avg_pp: 4.2\n      emperor_rephrase_mae_avg_pp: 7.1\n      emperor_shuffle_mae_avg_pp: 9.3\n      dcr_mae_avg_pp: 3.4\n      # Significance\n      baselines_significantly_beaten: 7\n      dcr_pairwise_p_value: 0.003\n      dcr_mae_delta_pp: 1.9\n      # Posterior predictive checks\n      residual_correlation_mean: 0.04\n      residual_correlation_max: 0.09\n      # Cross-seed\n      mae_std_across_seeds_pp: 0.3\n      # γ reliability\n      gamma_rel_bias_avg: 0.05\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下ContamCal per-benchmark γ_k model在所有metrics上达到目标。\n\n      MAE=1.5pp(avg across 4 benchmarks)远低于naive raw scores(11.2pp)——这是headline\n      result。MMLU MAE最低(1.2pp)因为它有最多items(14K)提供最强statistical power。\n      HumanEval最高(1.9pp)因为N=164限制了4PL item parameter estimation精度，但仍well\n      within best档[0.8, 2.0]范围。\n\n      per-benchmark γ_k优于global γ(MAE 1.5 vs 2.1pp)因为contamination效应确实\n      benchmark-heterogeneous：MMLU(知识密集MC)的γ_k=0.42最大，因为paraphrase污染\n      对knowledge recall的inflation效应最强；HumanEval的γ_k=0.28最小，因为code generation\n      即使memorized test case也需要实际produce correct code，inflation效应被execution\n      evaluation部分抵消。这个3×range(0.28-0.42)验证了per-benchmark modeling的必要性。\n      所有4个γ_k的CI exclude zero——best档关键假设成立。\n\n      7个baselines全部被significantly beat(best档要求6-7)：\n      - Raw(11.2pp)：no adjustment, largest gap\n      - Emperor rephrase/shuffle(7.1/9.3pp)：mitigation strategies确实ineffective，\n        验证了\"Emperor's New Clothes\"finding——rephrasing reduces inflation but不eliminate\n      - Remove-rescore(6.8pp)：dropping flagged items loses information，且threshold\n        choice arbitrary\n      - Vanilla 4PL(8.4pp)：不modeling contamination则θ absorbs inflation as spurious ability\n      - Linear regression(4.2pp)：captures linear contamination effect但misses nonlinear\n        IRT structure和item-level heterogeneity\n      - DCR(3.4pp)：最强baseline，provides adjusted accuracy但lacks uncertainty bounds\n        且assumes linear adjustment。ContamCal beats DCR by 1.9pp(p=0.003)——\n        IRT structure和measurement error model的价值体现\n      - Single-signal 2PL+γ(3.9pp)：使用best single signal + simpler IRT，\n        shows both multi-signal fusion和4PL complexity contribute\n\n      coverage 93%(95% level)和81%(80% level)均在nominal范围——measurement error model\n      的效果在real data上confirmed。Kendall τ=0.96表示model ranking几乎preserved——\n      calibration不仅修正absolute scores还保持relative ordering。\n\n      dose-response严格单调且R²=0.97(near-linear)：γ效应随contamination dosage线性增长，\n      这是best档的关键假设。说明contamination效应是additive而非saturating——\n      在observed dosage range(0-100%)内没有ceiling effect。\n\n      posterior predictive checks: residual correlation mean=0.04, max=0.09——\n      local independence violation存在但mild。这支持了论文的\"fit per-benchmark to reduce\n      correlation scope\"策略的有效性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Calibration MAE (pp) — ContamCal vs 7 Baselines × 4 Benchmarks\"\n        description: >\n          9 rows (ContamCal per-γ_k, ContamCal global-γ, 7 baselines) × 5 columns\n          (4 benchmarks + avg)。每cell含mean±std across seeds + bootstrap 95% CI。\n          Significance stars for pairwise tests vs ContamCal per-γ_k。\n      - name: \"Table 8: Coverage and Sharpness\"\n        description: >\n          ContamCal per-γ_k的coverage(50%/80%/95%) + CI width，by benchmark。\n          含nominal level reference lines。\n      - name: \"Table 9: Per-Benchmark γ_k Estimates\"\n        description: >\n          4 rows (benchmarks) × columns for γ_k posterior mean, 95% CI, CI excludes zero (Y/N)。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 6a: MAE bar chart with bootstrap CIs for all 9 methods。ContamCal clearly lowest。\"\n      - \"Fig 6b: Calibration scatter plot (predicted vs true clean accuracy) per benchmark。Points cluster around diagonal。\"\n      - \"Fig 6c: Dose-response curve (dosage vs estimated γ effect) showing strict monotonicity with R²=0.97。\"\n      - \"Fig 6d: Per-benchmark γ_k forest plot with 95% CIs。All exclude zero, heterogeneity visible。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文的核心结果table/figure。per-benchmark γ_k model是primary，global γ是ablation。\n      DCR comparison(Δ=1.9pp, p=0.003)是必须highlight的——它是唯一existing method producing\n      adjusted accuracy，beating it significantly validates ContamCal的IRT-based approach。\n      coverage near-nominal(93%)加上measurement error model是Claim 3的empirical proof。\n      γ_k heterogeneity(0.28-0.42)同时是methodological validation(per-benchmark needed)\n      和empirical finding(code generation less inflated than knowledge recall)。\n\n  - name: scale_bridging_7b\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B controlled SFT injection at 5 dosages，验证calibration scalability。\n    expected_results:\n      mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp: 15.1\n      calibration_mae_avg_pp: 1.6\n      coverage_95_pct: 92\n      ci_width_sft_avg_pp: 3.3\n      kendall_tau_with_smaller_models: 0.95\n      mae_gap_vs_3b_pp: 0.1\n      gamma_k_mmlu_7b: 0.44\n      sft_training_time_hours_per_run: 6.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下7B results与0.5B-3B highly consistent。MAE=1.6pp仅比smaller models(1.5pp)\n      高0.1pp——difference not statistically significant。7B的inflation略高(15.1 vs 14.3pp\n      at 100%)因为larger model capacity enables stronger memorization，但ContamCal的\n      calibration同样effective因为γ_k captures this scale-dependent effect。\n\n      coverage(92%)和CI width(3.3pp)与smaller scales comparable。γ_k(MMLU)=0.44 vs\n      smaller models的0.42——contamination效应在7B略stronger但在γ_k parameter化下被\n      naturally absorbed。Kendall τ=0.95包含7B在ranking中的correct placement。\n\n      关键takeaway：ContamCal的calibration accuracy不degrade at 7B scale——IRT model的\n      item-level structure在larger models上同样valid因为contamination仍通过item-level\n      exposure mechanism起作用，不因为model规模改变机制。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10: 7B Scale Bridging — MAE and Coverage Comparison\"\n        description: >\n          Side-by-side: 0.5B/1.5B/3B/7B的MAE, coverage, CI width, γ_k per benchmark。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 7: MAE as function of model scale (0.5B→7B)。Flat line with error bars demonstrating scale-invariance。\"\n    analysis: >\n      7B validation回应reviewer concern #4(Scale limited to 3B)。The near-identical MAE\n      (1.6 vs 1.5pp)provides evidence that ContamCal generalizes beyond training-efficient\n      small model regime。Combined with exp-012(72B observational)构成complete scale story。\n\n  - name: signal_survival_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      4 signals × 4 training regimes的systematic AUC heatmap。Core Contribution 2。\n    expected_results:\n      # Signal × Regime AUC matrix\n      embedding_auc_base: 0.55\n      embedding_auc_sft_clean: 0.57\n      embedding_auc_sft_contaminated: 0.88\n      embedding_auc_rl_post: 0.54\n      minkpp_auc_base: 0.52\n      minkpp_auc_sft_clean: 0.53\n      minkpp_auc_sft_contaminated: 0.84\n      minkpp_auc_rl_post: 0.51\n      constat_auc_base: 0.51\n      constat_auc_sft_clean: 0.52\n      constat_auc_sft_contaminated: 0.81\n      constat_auc_rl_post: 0.58\n      self_critique_auc_base: 0.50\n      self_critique_auc_sft_clean: 0.51\n      self_critique_auc_sft_contaminated: 0.77\n      self_critique_auc_rl_post: 0.65\n      # Derived metrics\n      cliff_sharpness_embedding: 0.95\n      cliff_sharpness_minkpp: 0.92\n      cliff_onset_epoch: 2\n      self_critique_rl_survival_rate: 0.84\n      signal_regime_interaction_p: \"<0.001\"\n      rl_best_single_signal_auc: 0.65\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下signal survival analysis揭示了cliff-like degradation pattern——这是论文\n      最genuinely novel的empirical finding。\n\n      SFT-contaminated regime下所有4个signals表现良好(AUC 0.77-0.88)，但RL post-training\n      后embedding和Min-K%++几乎完全失效(AUC 0.54/0.51, ~chance)。这是cliff-like而非\n      gradual——degradation在RL training的前2-3 epochs内完成(cliff_onset_epoch=2)，\n      之后stabilize near chance。机制：RL(GRPO)优化的是behavioral outcome(reward)而非\n      token-level likelihood——这\"洗掉\"了SFT阶段在logit/embedding space中留下的\n      contamination fingerprint。embedding和Min-K%++恰好依赖这些low-level features，\n      因此被RL彻底破坏。\n\n      ConStat在RL后表现moderate(0.58)——它测量original vs paraphrased performance gap，\n      这个behavioral signal部分survive因为RL不直接optimize对paraphrased items的performance，\n      但noise增加因为RL改变了model的general problem-solving strategy。\n\n      Self-Critique在RL后表现最好(0.65)——它依赖model的meta-cognitive报告(\"have you seen\n      this before?\")，这个higher-level signal比low-level likelihood features更robust to\n      RL因为RL不directly optimize meta-cognition about training data familiarity。\n      AUC=0.65在best档signal_auc_rl_best_single [0.62, 0.75]范围内。\n\n      cliff sharpness(embedding 0.95, Min-K++ 0.92)量化了degradation的abruptness——\n      接近1.0意味着transition从high-AUC到near-chance发生在very narrow epoch window内。\n      这是\"cliff-like, not gradual\"claim的定量支撑。\n\n      signal×regime interaction highly significant(p<0.001)——不同signals在不同regimes\n      下的相对ranking发生了qualitative reversal(embedding在SFT下最强但在RL下最弱)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11: Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap\"\n        description: >\n          4 signals × 4 regimes矩阵。Heat-colored。Bottom row shows best-single and RRF composite per regime。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 8a: AUC heatmap (signal × regime)。Hot colors for SFT-contaminated, cold for RL。Clear block structure。\"\n      - \"Fig 8b: Signal degradation trajectory over RL training epochs。Embedding/Min-K++ show cliff at epoch 2-3, Self-Critique shows gradual mild decline。\"\n      - \"Fig 8c: Per-signal AUC violin plots grouped by regime。Demonstrates distribution shift from SFT to RL。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Signal survival是Core Contribution 2的foundation。cliff-like pattern有两个implications：\n      (1) for detection community——reports of \"RL breaks detection\" are confirmed but mechanism\n      is regime-specific(logit-based signals die, meta-cognitive signals survive)，\n      (2) for ContamCal——RRF must be regime-aware或at minimum include Self-Critique。\n      best档下Self-Critique的RL AUC=0.65(above 0.60 threshold)意味着ContamCal在RL regime\n      下仍functional，虽然CI appropriately wider(exp-005)。\n\n  - name: multi_family_validation\n    plan_id: exp-014\n    description: >\n      Llama-3.2-1B和Pythia-1.4B controlled SFT injection at 3 dosage levels(0%/25%/100%)，\n      验证cross-family generalization。\n    expected_results:\n      llama_mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp: 13.1\n      llama_calibration_mae_avg_pp: 1.7\n      llama_coverage_95_pct: 91\n      pythia_mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp: 12.6\n      pythia_calibration_mae_avg_pp: 1.8\n      pythia_coverage_95_pct: 90\n      multi_family_mae_gap_vs_qwen_pp: 0.3\n      llama_gamma_k_mmlu: 0.39\n      pythia_gamma_k_mmlu: 0.37\n      identifiability_boundary_consistent: true\n      cross_family_kendall_tau: 0.94\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下multi-family validation成功——Llama和Pythia的calibration精度与Qwen高度一致。\n      MAE gap仅0.3pp(well within best档[0.0, 1.0]范围)。\n\n      Llama-3.2-1B的inflation(13.1pp at 100%)略低于同scale Qwen(14.3pp at 100% for 0.5B-3B\n      avg)因为Llama的pre-training data composition不同，可能与benchmark的lexical overlap\n      patterns不同。但ContamCal的MAE(1.7pp)几乎identical因为IRT model captures\n      contamination通过item-level exposure mechanism——这个mechanism is architecture-agnostic。\n\n      Pythia-1.4B作为fundamentally不同的architecture family(GPT-NeoX based)提供了最强的\n      generalization evidence。inflation略低(12.6pp)和MAE略高(1.8pp)可能因为Pythia's\n      smaller pre-training corpus使base ability lower，contamination的relative effect\n      不同。但calibration仍effective——MAE 1.8pp在best档range内。\n\n      γ_k values(Llama 0.39, Pythia 0.37 for MMLU)vs Qwen(0.42)展示了family-dependent\n      contamination susceptibility，但都在same order of magnitude——ContamCal的γ_k\n      parametrization naturally accommodates this variation。\n\n      identifiability boundaries consistent across families：AUC threshold ~0.70对所有\n      three families成立，因为identifiability取决于signal quality和sample size，不取决于\n      model architecture。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 12: Multi-Family Calibration Comparison\"\n        description: >\n          Rows: Qwen2.5-1.5B, Llama-3.2-1B, Pythia-1.4B (matched scale)。\n          Columns: MAE, coverage, CI width, γ_k(MMLU), per benchmark。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 9: Cross-family MAE comparison bar chart with bootstrap CIs。Overlapping CIs demonstrate no significant family effect。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Multi-family validation回应reviewer concern #11。best档下Qwen/Llama/Pythia三族的\n      MAE CIs overlap(1.5±0.3, 1.7±0.4, 1.8±0.4)——no significant family effect。\n      这支持了ContamCal的generalizability claim：method不依赖于specific model family\n      的idiosyncratic properties。Pythia作为non-Transformer-derivative(虽然仍是transformer，\n      但不同design lineage)尤其有说服力。\n\n  - name: rl_observational_case_study\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      RL-trained models的observational case study：Qwen2.5-Instruct(0.5B-7B) + DeepSeek-R1-Distill。\n      Expected regret quantification + near-zero γ specificity test。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_instruct_3b_gamma_mmlu: 0.18\n      qwen_instruct_7b_gamma_mmlu: 0.22\n      deepseek_r1_7b_gamma_mmlu: 0.15\n      ci_width_rl_avg_pp: 7.8\n      coverage_95_rl_pct: 91\n      regret_uncalibrated_top5_pct: 40\n      regret_calibrated_top5_pct: 10\n      regret_remove_rescore_top5_pct: 25\n      near_zero_gamma_clean_benchmark: true\n      near_zero_gamma_value: 0.02\n      near_zero_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n      rl_calibrated_score_shift_avg_pp: 4.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下RL case study提供了convincing directional evidence。γ estimates for RL models\n      (0.15-0.22 for MMLU)低于SFT-only contaminated models(~0.42)——这合理因为(1) RL models\n      的contamination可能less severe(instruction tuning data不一定systematic include\n      benchmark paraphrases)，(2) RL partially masks contamination signal导致γ被\n      underestimated(wider CIs correctly reflect this uncertainty)。\n\n      CI width 7.8pp(vs SFT的3.1pp)——这是best档要求的ci_width_rl_pp [5.0, 10.0]范围。\n      RL regime的wider CIs是honest uncertainty，不是methodological failure。Coverage 91%\n      (using held-out clean benchmark as ground truth)表明CIs calibrated correctly even\n      in RL regime。\n\n      Expected regret analysis是practical motivation的定量展示：uncalibrated top-5 model\n      selection有40% regret(选错model因为contaminated scores mislead ranking)，\n      ContamCal calibrated selection降到10%，remove-rescore降到25%。ContamCal的优势来自\n      (1) 使用uncertainty-aware selection(high-uncertainty models deprioritized)，\n      (2) continuous exposure scores比binary flag更fine-grained。\n\n      near-zero γ check: 在known-clean benchmark(LiveBench recent items)上γ=0.02，\n      CI includes zero——specificity test PASS。ContamCal不在clean data上hallucinate\n      contamination。这回应了\"false positive\"concern。\n\n      ground truth for regret = held-out clean benchmark scores，NOT calibrated scores——\n      explicitly avoiding circularity(reviewer concern #12)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: RL Observational Case Study — γ Estimates with CIs\"\n        description: >\n          Rows: 6 RL models。Columns: γ_k per benchmark, 95% CI, CI width。\n      - name: \"Table 14: Expected Regret — Uncalibrated vs Calibrated vs Remove-Rescore\"\n        description: >\n          Top-K model selection regret at K=3,5,10 for 3 methods。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 10a: γ forest plot for RL models with wide CIs。Compared against SFT-contaminated γ (narrower, larger)。\"\n      - \"Fig 10b: Regret curve (K vs regret %) for 3 methods。ContamCal consistently lowest。\"\n      - \"Fig 10c: Near-zero γ check on clean benchmark — posterior concentrated around zero。\"\n    analysis: >\n      RL case study是external validity pillar。best档下directional results清晰：\n      contamination effects detected(γ>0 point estimates)but with appropriate uncertainty\n      (wide CIs)。regret analysis是论文practical motivation的最compelling evidence——\n      即使在RL regime下ContamCal仍提供better model selection。near-zero γ check的pass\n      是critical because it shows ContamCal不是systematically biased toward finding\n      contamination everywhere——it can correctly identify clean benchmarks。\n\n  - name: observational_72b\n    plan_id: exp-012\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-72B inference-only observational analysis。Extends ecological validity to frontier scale。\n    expected_results:\n      gamma_mmlu_72b: 0.25\n      gamma_mmlu_72b_ci: \"[0.08, 0.43]\"\n      ci_width_pp: 8.5\n      calibrated_mmlu_shift_pp: 5.8\n      signal_auc_self_critique_72b: 0.62\n      inference_cost_hours: 12\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下72B observational results directionally consistent with smaller scales。\n      γ(MMLU)=0.25 with wide CI [0.08, 0.43]——contamination detected但uncertainty large\n      因为(1) only 1 model at this scale(no population)，(2) 72B likely RL-trained导致\n      signal degradation。CI width 8.5pp reflects这些limitations。\n\n      calibrated MMLU score shift 5.8pp downward——如果true则meaningful(72B的reported MMLU\n      accuracy overestimated by ~6 points)。但wide CI means this could be as low as 2pp\n      or as high as 10pp。Self-Critique AUC=0.62(at identifiability boundary)——72B的\n      strong meta-cognition partially compensates for RL signal degradation。\n\n      这个result的价值是ecological validity at frontier scale，不是quantitative precision。\n      论文应frame为\"ContamCal suggests [X]pp overestimation with substantial uncertainty\"\n      而非precise claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 15: 72B Observational Results\"\n        description: >\n          Single-row summary: γ_k per benchmark, CIs, calibrated score shifts。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 11: 72B γ posterior density plot with 95% CI shaded。Wide but informative。\"\n    analysis: >\n      72B analysis回应reviewer concern #4(scale)。Combined with 7B controlled(exp-007)，\n      构成complete scale story from 0.5B to 72B。Key message：ContamCal scales to frontier\n      models but honest about uncertainty at N=1。\n\n  - name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n    plan_id: exp-013\n    description: >\n      ConStat + Self-Critique only(no logits/embeddings)的degraded mode calibration。\n    expected_results:\n      two_signal_rrf_auc_sft: 0.83\n      two_signal_calibration_mae_avg_pp: 2.4\n      two_signal_coverage_95_pct: 90\n      two_signal_ci_width_sft_pp: 4.8\n      mae_gap_vs_4signal_pp: 0.9\n      coverage_gap_vs_4signal_pp: 3\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下2-signal mode仍functional但degraded。MAE 2.4pp(vs 4-signal的1.5pp，\n      gap=0.9pp)——degradation meaningful但2-signal mode仍beats all baselines\n      (closest baseline DCR at 3.4pp)。Coverage 90%(vs 93%)——at the boundary of nominal\n      but still acceptable。CI width wider(4.8pp vs 3.1pp)because fewer signals means\n      more uncertainty in exposure estimation。\n\n      degradation来自two sources：(1) fewer signals means lower composite AUC(0.83 vs 0.92)，\n      (2) ConStat和Self-Critique are the two weaker signals in SFT regime。但它们是\n      closed-weight applicable signals，所以这个trade-off是practical necessity。\n\n      2-signal mode beats DCR(2.4 vs 3.4pp)说明即使在degraded mode下IRT-based approach\n      仍优于heuristic adjustment——IRT structure的value不完全来自signal quality。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 16: 4-Signal vs 2-Signal Mode Comparison\"\n        description: >\n          Side-by-side: MAE, coverage, CI width, Kendall τ for both modes across 4 benchmarks。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 12: Degradation waterfall chart showing MAE increase from 4-signal to 2-signal, decomposed by signal removal。\"\n    analysis: >\n      2-signal mode是practical extensibility result。best档下它仍beats all baselines，\n      meaning ContamCal applicable even to closed-weight models(GPT-4, Claude)where\n      only behavioral signals available。MAE gap(0.9pp)是quantified cost of closed-weight\n      constraint——practitioners can decide if this trade-off acceptable for their use case。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12672,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12672},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bda79b13-dcb4-43f9-84c9-2136dd5f87f5","uuid":"ef4fe322-aabd-4a41-a124-365992fe3592"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":292619,"duration_api_ms":293765,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始framing完全成立。ContamCal作为\"statistical safety net\"在SFT和RL regime下均可靠工作。\n  三条claims无需调整：(1)校准claim以全部4 benchmark × 3 scale × 2 family的显著MAE改进支撑，\n  (2)信号生存claim以清晰的signal×regime AUC heatmap和cliff-like degradation定量支撑，\n  (3)identifiability claim以Fisher Information理论界 + 144条件仿真 + 实际数据一致性三重验证。\n  Headline: \"ContamCal recovers true performance within <2pp MAE with near-nominal CI coverage,\n  while naive scores overestimate by 8-15pp.\" DCR和所有其他baseline被显著beat。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: controlled_sft_injection\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B × 5 dosage levels (0%/5%/25%/50%/100%) × 3 seeds = 45 SFT runs。\n      72B-Instruct生成paraphrases，BLEU<0.3 + cosine>0.85确保evade n-gram同时保留语义污染。\n    expected_results:\n      mmlu_inflation_0pct_pp: 0.0\n      mmlu_inflation_5pct_pp: 1.8\n      mmlu_inflation_25pct_pp: 5.2\n      mmlu_inflation_50pct_pp: 9.1\n      mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp: 14.3\n      gsm8k_inflation_100pct_pp: 11.7\n      arc_inflation_100pct_pp: 12.4\n      humaneval_inflation_100pct_pp: 8.9\n      paraphrase_cosine_similarity_mean: 0.89\n      paraphrase_bleu_mean: 0.22\n      ngram_decontam_evasion_rate_pct: 97.3\n      inflation_std_across_seeds_pp: 0.6\n      scale_effect_3b_vs_0_5b_ratio: 1.15\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下contamination injection完全按预期工作。MMLU作为knowledge-intensive MC benchmark\n      对paraphrase污染最敏感，100% dosage产生~14pp inflation，与\"Rethinking Benchmark and\n      Contamination\"报告的8-15pp范围上端一致。inflation随dosage严格单调递增——5%仅1.8pp因为\n      只有~700/14000 items被污染，而100%覆盖全部items产生最大效应。GSM8K和ARC略低因为\n      reasoning benchmarks的contamination效应更依赖solution memorization而非答案记忆。\n      HumanEval最低(8.9pp)因为N=164且代码生成的paraphrase更难保留原始test case语义。\n      跨seed std仅0.6pp表明injection pipeline高度可复现。3B模型inflation比0.5B略高(1.15×)\n      因为更大模型有更强的memorization capacity，但差异不大因为SFT均使用相同epoch数。\n      paraphrase质量指标全部达标：cosine>0.85确保语义等价，BLEU<0.3确保lexical divergence，\n      97.3% evasion rate验证n-gram decontamination确实无效。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: Contamination Inflation (pp) by Benchmark × Dosage × Scale\"\n        description: >\n          15行(3 scale × 5 dosage) × 4列(benchmarks)矩阵，每cell为mean±std across 3 seeds。\n          展示inflation严格随dosage单调增长，scale效应存在但secondary。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1a: Dose-response curves (dosage% vs inflation pp) per benchmark,分panel by model scale，含error bars。展示严格单调性。\"\n      - \"Fig 1b: Paraphrase quality scatter plot (cosine similarity vs BLEU) for 200 sampled pairs，展示high-semantic-low-lexical zone。\"\n    analysis: >\n      injection pipeline的成功是整个ContamCal validation的基础。best档下所有4 benchmarks\n      在所有dosage levels产生statistically significant inflation (5%的p<0.05, 25%+的p<0.001)，\n      为exp-006的ground-truth calibration评估提供了clean/contaminated pairs。\n      跨scale一致性(std<1pp)意味着calibration结论不受model scale confounding。\n\n  - name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      对exp-001全部45个contaminated+clean模型计算4个detection signals的per-item exposure scores。\n    expected_results:\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_100pct: 0.88\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_25pct: 0.82\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_5pct: 0.71\n      minkpp_auc_sft_100pct: 0.84\n      minkpp_auc_sft_25pct: 0.76\n      minkpp_auc_sft_5pct: 0.64\n      constat_auc_sft_100pct: 0.81\n      constat_auc_sft_25pct: 0.74\n      constat_auc_sft_5pct: 0.62\n      self_critique_auc_sft_100pct: 0.77\n      self_critique_auc_sft_25pct: 0.70\n      self_critique_auc_sft_5pct: 0.59\n      signal_rank_correlation_across_scales: 0.91\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下所有4个signals在SFT regime表现良好。embedding retrieval最强(AUC=0.88 at 100%)\n      因为SFT直接改变了model对contaminated items的internal representation，semantic retrieval\n      能直接捕捉training data与test item的embedding proximity。Min-K%++次之(0.84)因为SFT\n      显著改变了contaminated items的token-level likelihood分布。ConStat(0.81)通过original\n      vs paraphrased performance gap检测，在paraphrase质量高时信号清晰。Self-Critique最低\n      (0.77)因为它依赖model的meta-cognitive ability来报告自身对数据的familiarity，在小模型\n      (0.5B)上meta-cognition较弱。所有signals的AUC随dosage下降因为低dosage下被污染items\n      比例小，signal-to-noise ratio降低。5% dosage时最弱signal(Self-Critique)降至0.59，\n      接近identifiability边界但仍above chance。跨scale rank correlation 0.91表明signal\n      ranking在不同model sizes间稳定——这对实践者选择signal组合很重要。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: Per-Signal AUC by Dosage × Scale\"\n        description: >\n          4 signals × 5 dosages × 3 scales的完整AUC矩阵。展示signal hierarchy和dosage敏感性。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2: Signal AUC heatmap (signal × dosage)，averaged across scales。颜色从deep blue(0.5)到deep red(0.9)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      4个signals提供了互补的contamination detection视角。embedding和Min-K%++依赖model internals\n      (logits/embeddings)，AUC最高但require open weights。ConStat和Self-Critique仅需\n      behavioral access，AUC较低但applicable to closed-weight models。这个hierarchy在best档下\n      清晰且一致，为exp-003的RRF aggregation和exp-013的2-signal degraded mode提供了基础。\n\n  - name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      RRF fusion of 4 signals + ablations: RRF vs rank averaging, single-signal, calibration-weighted,\n      FP injection robustness, 2-signal degraded mode。\n    expected_results:\n      rrf_composite_auc_sft_100pct: 0.92\n      rrf_composite_auc_sft_25pct: 0.85\n      rrf_composite_auc_sft_5pct: 0.78\n      rank_avg_auc_sft_100pct: 0.89\n      best_single_signal_auc_sft_100pct: 0.88\n      calibration_weighted_rrf_auc_sft_100pct: 0.91\n      rrf_auc_at_10pct_fp_injection: 0.89\n      rrf_auc_at_20pct_fp_injection: 0.85\n      two_signal_mode_auc_sft_100pct: 0.83\n      rrf_vs_best_single_delta: 0.04\n      rrf_vs_rank_avg_delta: 0.03\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下RRF composite AUC达0.92(SFT 100%)，显著高于best single signal(0.88, Δ=0.04)，\n      验证了multi-signal fusion的价值。RRF优于rank averaging(Δ=0.03)因为RRF的reciprocal rank\n      weighting自然downweights disagreeing signals，对noisy signals更robust。calibration-weighted\n      variant(0.91)反而略低于standard RRF(0.92)——这支持了meta-circularity argument：\n      learned weights依赖contamination labels来训练，而这些labels本身可能被污染，引入circular\n      dependency。Standard RRF作为parameter-free method避免了这个问题。这是论文中\"RRF is a\n      principled design choice, not contribution\"的定量支撑。FP injection at 10%/20%仅使AUC\n      下降0.03/0.07，展示了RRF对individual signal noise的robustness。2-signal mode(ConStat\n      + Self-Critique)AUC=0.83，比4-signal低0.09但仍well above identifiability threshold(0.70)，\n      为closed-weight scenario提供了viable fallback。5% dosage时composite AUC=0.78，恰好在\n      best档要求的signal_auc_sft_rrf [0.78, 0.92]下界。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: Aggregation Method Comparison\"\n        description: >\n          Rows: RRF, rank-avg, cal-weighted, 4×single-signal, 2-signal mode。\n          Columns: AUC at 5%/25%/50%/100% dosage。含bootstrap 95% CI。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3a: Ablation bar chart showing composite AUC by aggregation method at 100% dosage。\"\n      - \"Fig 3b: FP injection robustness curve (FP rate vs composite AUC decline)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      RRF的优势在best档下清晰但not dramatic(Δ=0.03-0.04 over alternatives)。\n      关键insight不是RRF比alternatives好多少，而是calibration-weighted variant不比RRF好——\n      这定量支撑了anti-meta-circularity论点。论文应强调RRF是principled default而非\n      performance-maximizing choice。2-signal mode AUC=0.83为Claim 2的closed-weight\n      extensibility提供了evidence。\n\n  - name: simulation_identifiability_sweep\n    plan_id: exp-004\n    description: >\n      144-condition simulation sweep: AUC(6) × N_models(4) × prior(3) × exposure_type(2)，\n      10 seeds each。含Fisher Information analysis和Growing Pains pre-estimation。\n    expected_results:\n      gamma_recovery_rmse_auc070_n50: 0.09\n      gamma_recovery_rmse_auc080_n50: 0.06\n      gamma_recovery_rmse_auc055_n50: 0.21\n      gamma_ci_excludes_zero_rate_auc070_n50_pct: 94\n      gamma_ci_excludes_zero_rate_auc060_n50_pct: 72\n      gamma_ci_excludes_zero_rate_auc055_n50_pct: 48\n      theta_gamma_posterior_corr_auc070: -0.18\n      theta_gamma_posterior_corr_auc090: -0.07\n      coverage_95_auc070_n50_pct: 93\n      coverage_80_auc070_n50_pct: 82\n      coverage_95_auc055_n20_pct: 78\n      fisher_info_gamma_threshold_auc: 0.68\n      fisher_info_n_models_threshold: 35\n      growing_pains_improvement_n20_rmse_delta: -0.04\n      prior_sensitivity_rmse_range_at_n50: 0.02\n      gamma_rel_bias_auc070_n50: 0.05\n      gamma_rel_bias_auc080_n50: 0.03\n      practical_identifiability_boundary_auc: 0.65\n      structural_identifiability_boundary_auc: 0.58\n      convergence_rate_pct_all_conditions: 98.6\n      mmlu_gamma_k_ci_excludes_zero: true\n      gsm8k_gamma_k_ci_excludes_zero: true\n      arc_gamma_k_ci_excludes_zero: true\n      humaneval_gamma_k_ci_excludes_zero: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下identifiability结果全面积极。核心发现：AUC≥0.70时γ recovery RMSE=0.09，\n      CI excludes zero in 94% of runs——这确立了practical identifiability threshold。\n      Fisher Information analysis提供了解析基础：I(γ) ∝ N_models × AUC²/(1-AUC²)，\n      当AUC=0.68时Fisher Information跨越了practical identifiability门槛(对应γ的\n      expected CI width < 0.3)。这与empirical threshold(~0.70)高度一致，构成了理论-实证\n      双重验证。structural identifiability boundary更低(AUC=0.58)——参数在数学上unique\n      但estimation precision不足以支撑决策。这个distinction(structural vs practical)是\n      论文的理论贡献之一。\n\n      θ-γ posterior correlation在AUC=0.70时为-0.18——轻微负相关因为contamination inflation\n      和true ability有inherent trade-off，但不足以造成identifiability问题。AUC=0.90时\n      correlation降至-0.07因为更精确的exposure signal使θ和γ更好分离。\n\n      coverage在AUC≥0.70/N≥50时达93%(95% CI)和82%(80% CI)，均在best档nominal范围内。\n      AUC=0.55/N=20时coverage仅78%——这是\"cannot distinguish\"zone，论文需明确标注。\n\n      prior sensitivity在N≥50时很小(RMSE range仅0.02 across 3 priors)——数据dominant\n      prior。N=20时prior matters more，Growing Pains pre-estimation在此regime提供RMSE\n      improvement of 0.04——meaningful but不改变qualitative conclusions。\n\n      per-benchmark γ_k在所有4 benchmarks上CI exclude zero(含HumanEval N=164)——这是\n      best档的关键假设。HumanEval能convergence因为(1) 4PL的contamination效应γ_k不需要\n      per-item estimation精度，(2) 164 items在4PL下仍sufficient for γ的population-level\n      estimation，(3) measurement error model将item-level noise上推到γ_k的posterior width\n      而非bias。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 4: γ Recovery RMSE × Coverage Matrix (AUC × N_models)\"\n        description: >\n          6×4 matrix, cells含RMSE和95% coverage。Heat-colored by identifiability quality。\n          Clear boundary line at AUC≈0.68, N≈35。\n      - name: \"Table 5: Fisher Information Analytical vs Empirical Thresholds\"\n        description: >\n          Side-by-side comparison of I(γ)-derived thresholds and simulation-observed boundaries。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4a: Identifiability phase diagram (AUC × N_models plane)，colored by γ CI-excludes-zero rate。Sharp transition at AUC≈0.68。\"\n      - \"Fig 4b: Fisher Information I(γ) as function of AUC，with horizontal line at practical threshold。Analytical curve overlaid with simulation points。\"\n      - \"Fig 4c: Prior sensitivity fan chart at N=20 vs N=50 vs N=200。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文Claim 3的核心支撑。Fisher Information analysis将empirical threshold提升为\n      theoretically grounded result——reviewer可以verify the math而非仅rely on simulation。\n      structural vs practical identifiability distinction直接回应\"θ and γ identifiable?\"\n      reviewer concern。144 conditions的completeness使结论robust to cherry-picking accusation。\n      per-benchmark γ_k全部converge(含HumanEval)意味着论文可以confidently report per-benchmark\n      results而非仅global γ。\n\n  - name: noise_propagation_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      (A) Measurement error model: exposure_ij ~ N(τ_ij, σ_e²)，propagate Stage 1 uncertainty。\n      (B) Post-hoc noise injection at 1×/1.5×/2× levels。\n    expected_results:\n      coverage_95_point_estimate_pct: 83\n      coverage_95_measurement_error_model_pct: 93\n      coverage_80_point_estimate_pct: 69\n      coverage_80_measurement_error_model_pct: 81\n      coverage_50_measurement_error_model_pct: 52\n      ci_width_sft_point_estimate_pp: 1.8\n      ci_width_sft_measurement_error_pp: 3.1\n      ci_width_rl_measurement_error_pp: 7.2\n      gamma_bias_point_estimate: 0.04\n      gamma_bias_measurement_error: 0.05\n      noise_injection_1x_coverage_95_pct: 86\n      noise_injection_1_5x_coverage_95_pct: 89\n      noise_injection_2x_coverage_95_pct: 93\n      sigma_e_estimated_sft: 0.12\n      sigma_e_estimated_rl: 0.28\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下measurement error model成功将coverage从sub-nominal(83% at 95% level)提升到\n      near-nominal(93%)。机制清晰：point-estimate exposure将Stage 1的estimation error\n      \"frozen\"进IRT fitting，导致posterior underestimates uncertainty。Measurement error model\n      通过latent τ layer自动将σ_e uncertainty propagate到γ和θ的posteriors中。\n\n      coverage gap在point-estimate baseline下约12pp(83% vs 95% nominal)——这正是MVP中\n      观察到的gap来源。measurement error model闭合了大部分gap(93% vs 95%)，剩余2pp gap\n      来自local independence violation(single model responses correlated)和4PL model\n      misspecification(真实item characteristics并非exactly 4PL)。\n\n      CI width从1.8pp(point-estimate)增至3.1pp(measurement error, SFT)——这是\"honest\n      uncertainty\"的代价。RL regime下CI更宽(7.2pp)因为σ_e更大(0.28 vs 0.12)——RL\n      post-training使detection signals更noisy，measurement error model正确reflect这一点。\n      这直接支撑了论文的\"wide CIs are the correct answer\"framing。\n\n      γ bias几乎不变(0.04→0.05)——measurement error model主要影响precision(CI width)\n      而非accuracy(point estimate)。这是desirable property：不牺牲accuracy来换coverage。\n\n      post-hoc noise injection(Part B)展示了清晰的coverage-noise relationship：\n      at 2× noise level coverage恢复到93%，与measurement error model一致。\n      这提供了independent validation——两种不同方法得到相同的coverage correction。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6: Coverage Comparison — Point Estimate vs Measurement Error Model\"\n        description: >\n          Rows: 50%/80%/95% nominal levels × {point-estimate, measurement-error, post-hoc 1×/1.5×/2×}。\n          Columns: SFT regime, RL regime。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 5a: Coverage calibration plot (nominal level vs actual coverage)。Diagonal=perfect。Point-estimate below diagonal, measurement error model on diagonal。\"\n      - \"Fig 5b: CI width distribution (violin plot) for SFT vs RL regime under measurement error model。RL clearly wider。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Measurement error model是ContamCal的architectural必要组件而非optional enhancement。\n      没有它coverage为83%——reviewer会rightfully question credible intervals的reliability。\n      SFT/RL regime下σ_e的2.3×差异(0.12 vs 0.28)提供了regime-aware uncertainty的自动机制，\n      无需手动adjust priors。这是Claim 3(uncertainty quantification)的核心technical支撑。\n\n  - name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      4PL+γ IRT(global和per-benchmark γ_k两个variants)在exp-001 controlled data上fitting，\n      与7个baselines对比，5个metrics评估。\n    expected_results:\n      # Per-benchmark γ_k model (PRIMARY)\n      calibration_mae_mmlu_pp: 1.2\n      calibration_mae_gsm8k_pp: 1.5\n      calibration_mae_arc_pp: 1.4\n      calibration_mae_humaneval_pp: 1.9\n      calibration_mae_avg_pp: 1.5\n      coverage_95_pct: 93\n      coverage_80_pct: 81\n      coverage_50_pct: 52\n      ci_width_sft_avg_pp: 3.1\n      kendall_tau: 0.96\n      dose_response_monotonic: true\n      dose_response_r_squared: 0.97\n      # Global γ model (ABLATION)\n      global_gamma_mae_avg_pp: 2.1\n      global_gamma_coverage_95_pct: 88\n      # Per-benchmark γ_k values\n      gamma_k_mmlu: 0.42\n      gamma_k_gsm8k: 0.35\n      gamma_k_arc: 0.38\n      gamma_k_humaneval: 0.28\n      gamma_k_mmlu_ci: \"[0.31, 0.54]\"\n      gamma_k_gsm8k_ci: \"[0.22, 0.49]\"\n      gamma_k_arc_ci: \"[0.25, 0.52]\"\n      gamma_k_humaneval_ci: \"[0.11, 0.47]\"\n      # Baselines\n      raw_mae_avg_pp: 11.2\n      remove_rescore_mae_avg_pp: 6.8\n      single_signal_2pl_mae_avg_pp: 3.9\n      vanilla_4pl_mae_avg_pp: 8.4\n      linear_regression_mae_avg_pp: 4.2\n      emperor_rephrase_mae_avg_pp: 7.1\n      emperor_shuffle_mae_avg_pp: 9.3\n      dcr_mae_avg_pp: 3.4\n      # Significance\n      baselines_significantly_beaten: 7\n      dcr_pairwise_p_value: 0.003\n      dcr_mae_delta_pp: 1.9\n      # Posterior predictive checks\n      residual_correlation_mean: 0.04\n      residual_correlation_max: 0.09\n      # Cross-seed\n      mae_std_across_seeds_pp: 0.3\n      # γ reliability\n      gamma_rel_bias_avg: 0.05\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下ContamCal per-benchmark γ_k model在所有metrics上达到目标。\n\n      MAE=1.5pp(avg across 4 benchmarks)远低于naive raw scores(11.2pp)——这是headline\n      result。MMLU MAE最低(1.2pp)因为它有最多items(14K)提供最强statistical power。\n      HumanEval最高(1.9pp)因为N=164限制了4PL item parameter estimation精度，但仍well\n      within best档[0.8, 2.0]范围。\n\n      per-benchmark γ_k优于global γ(MAE 1.5 vs 2.1pp)因为contamination效应确实\n      benchmark-heterogeneous：MMLU(知识密集MC)的γ_k=0.42最大，因为paraphrase污染\n      对knowledge recall的inflation效应最强；HumanEval的γ_k=0.28最小，因为code generation\n      即使memorized test case也需要实际produce correct code，inflation效应被execution\n      evaluation部分抵消。这个3×range(0.28-0.42)验证了per-benchmark modeling的必要性。\n      所有4个γ_k的CI exclude zero——best档关键假设成立。\n\n      7个baselines全部被significantly beat(best档要求6-7)：\n      - Raw(11.2pp)：no adjustment, largest gap\n      - Emperor rephrase/shuffle(7.1/9.3pp)：mitigation strategies确实ineffective，\n        验证了\"Emperor's New Clothes\"finding——rephrasing reduces inflation but不eliminate\n      - Remove-rescore(6.8pp)：dropping flagged items loses information，且threshold\n        choice arbitrary\n      - Vanilla 4PL(8.4pp)：不modeling contamination则θ absorbs inflation as spurious ability\n      - Linear regression(4.2pp)：captures linear contamination effect但misses nonlinear\n        IRT structure和item-level heterogeneity\n      - DCR(3.4pp)：最强baseline，provides adjusted accuracy但lacks uncertainty bounds\n        且assumes linear adjustment。ContamCal beats DCR by 1.9pp(p=0.003)——\n        IRT structure和measurement error model的价值体现\n      - Single-signal 2PL+γ(3.9pp)：使用best single signal + simpler IRT，\n        shows both multi-signal fusion和4PL complexity contribute\n\n      coverage 93%(95% level)和81%(80% level)均在nominal范围——measurement error model\n      的效果在real data上confirmed。Kendall τ=0.96表示model ranking几乎preserved——\n      calibration不仅修正absolute scores还保持relative ordering。\n\n      dose-response严格单调且R²=0.97(near-linear)：γ效应随contamination dosage线性增长，\n      这是best档的关键假设。说明contamination效应是additive而非saturating——\n      在observed dosage range(0-100%)内没有ceiling effect。\n\n      posterior predictive checks: residual correlation mean=0.04, max=0.09——\n      local independence violation存在但mild。这支持了论文的\"fit per-benchmark to reduce\n      correlation scope\"策略的有效性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Calibration MAE (pp) — ContamCal vs 7 Baselines × 4 Benchmarks\"\n        description: >\n          9 rows (ContamCal per-γ_k, ContamCal global-γ, 7 baselines) × 5 columns\n          (4 benchmarks + avg)。每cell含mean±std across seeds + bootstrap 95% CI。\n          Significance stars for pairwise tests vs ContamCal per-γ_k。\n      - name: \"Table 8: Coverage and Sharpness\"\n        description: >\n          ContamCal per-γ_k的coverage(50%/80%/95%) + CI width，by benchmark。\n          含nominal level reference lines。\n      - name: \"Table 9: Per-Benchmark γ_k Estimates\"\n        description: >\n          4 rows (benchmarks) × columns for γ_k posterior mean, 95% CI, CI excludes zero (Y/N)。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 6a: MAE bar chart with bootstrap CIs for all 9 methods。ContamCal clearly lowest。\"\n      - \"Fig 6b: Calibration scatter plot (predicted vs true clean accuracy) per benchmark。Points cluster around diagonal。\"\n      - \"Fig 6c: Dose-response curve (dosage vs estimated γ effect) showing strict monotonicity with R²=0.97。\"\n      - \"Fig 6d: Per-benchmark γ_k forest plot with 95% CIs。All exclude zero, heterogeneity visible。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文的核心结果table/figure。per-benchmark γ_k model是primary，global γ是ablation。\n      DCR comparison(Δ=1.9pp, p=0.003)是必须highlight的——它是唯一existing method producing\n      adjusted accuracy，beating it significantly validates ContamCal的IRT-based approach。\n      coverage near-nominal(93%)加上measurement error model是Claim 3的empirical proof。\n      γ_k heterogeneity(0.28-0.42)同时是methodological validation(per-benchmark needed)\n      和empirical finding(code generation less inflated than knowledge recall)。\n\n  - name: scale_bridging_7b\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B controlled SFT injection at 5 dosages，验证calibration scalability。\n    expected_results:\n      mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp: 15.1\n      calibration_mae_avg_pp: 1.6\n      coverage_95_pct: 92\n      ci_width_sft_avg_pp: 3.3\n      kendall_tau_with_smaller_models: 0.95\n      mae_gap_vs_3b_pp: 0.1\n      gamma_k_mmlu_7b: 0.44\n      sft_training_time_hours_per_run: 6.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下7B results与0.5B-3B highly consistent。MAE=1.6pp仅比smaller models(1.5pp)\n      高0.1pp——difference not statistically significant。7B的inflation略高(15.1 vs 14.3pp\n      at 100%)因为larger model capacity enables stronger memorization，但ContamCal的\n      calibration同样effective因为γ_k captures this scale-dependent effect。\n\n      coverage(92%)和CI width(3.3pp)与smaller scales comparable。γ_k(MMLU)=0.44 vs\n      smaller models的0.42——contamination效应在7B略stronger但在γ_k parameter化下被\n      naturally absorbed。Kendall τ=0.95包含7B在ranking中的correct placement。\n\n      关键takeaway：ContamCal的calibration accuracy不degrade at 7B scale——IRT model的\n      item-level structure在larger models上同样valid因为contamination仍通过item-level\n      exposure mechanism起作用，不因为model规模改变机制。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10: 7B Scale Bridging — MAE and Coverage Comparison\"\n        description: >\n          Side-by-side: 0.5B/1.5B/3B/7B的MAE, coverage, CI width, γ_k per benchmark。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 7: MAE as function of model scale (0.5B→7B)。Flat line with error bars demonstrating scale-invariance。\"\n    analysis: >\n      7B validation回应reviewer concern #4(Scale limited to 3B)。The near-identical MAE\n      (1.6 vs 1.5pp)provides evidence that ContamCal generalizes beyond training-efficient\n      small model regime。Combined with exp-012(72B observational)构成complete scale story。\n\n  - name: signal_survival_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      4 signals × 4 training regimes的systematic AUC heatmap。Core Contribution 2。\n    expected_results:\n      # Signal × Regime AUC matrix\n      embedding_auc_base: 0.55\n      embedding_auc_sft_clean: 0.57\n      embedding_auc_sft_contaminated: 0.88\n      embedding_auc_rl_post: 0.54\n      minkpp_auc_base: 0.52\n      minkpp_auc_sft_clean: 0.53\n      minkpp_auc_sft_contaminated: 0.84\n      minkpp_auc_rl_post: 0.51\n      constat_auc_base: 0.51\n      constat_auc_sft_clean: 0.52\n      constat_auc_sft_contaminated: 0.81\n      constat_auc_rl_post: 0.58\n      self_critique_auc_base: 0.50\n      self_critique_auc_sft_clean: 0.51\n      self_critique_auc_sft_contaminated: 0.77\n      self_critique_auc_rl_post: 0.65\n      # Derived metrics\n      cliff_sharpness_embedding: 0.95\n      cliff_sharpness_minkpp: 0.92\n      cliff_onset_epoch: 2\n      self_critique_rl_survival_rate: 0.84\n      signal_regime_interaction_p: \"<0.001\"\n      rl_best_single_signal_auc: 0.65\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下signal survival analysis揭示了cliff-like degradation pattern——这是论文\n      最genuinely novel的empirical finding。\n\n      SFT-contaminated regime下所有4个signals表现良好(AUC 0.77-0.88)，但RL post-training\n      后embedding和Min-K%++几乎完全失效(AUC 0.54/0.51, ~chance)。这是cliff-like而非\n      gradual——degradation在RL training的前2-3 epochs内完成(cliff_onset_epoch=2)，\n      之后stabilize near chance。机制：RL(GRPO)优化的是behavioral outcome(reward)而非\n      token-level likelihood——这\"洗掉\"了SFT阶段在logit/embedding space中留下的\n      contamination fingerprint。embedding和Min-K%++恰好依赖这些low-level features，\n      因此被RL彻底破坏。\n\n      ConStat在RL后表现moderate(0.58)——它测量original vs paraphrased performance gap，\n      这个behavioral signal部分survive因为RL不直接optimize对paraphrased items的performance，\n      但noise增加因为RL改变了model的general problem-solving strategy。\n\n      Self-Critique在RL后表现最好(0.65)——它依赖model的meta-cognitive报告(\"have you seen\n      this before?\")，这个higher-level signal比low-level likelihood features更robust to\n      RL因为RL不directly optimize meta-cognition about training data familiarity。\n      AUC=0.65在best档signal_auc_rl_best_single [0.62, 0.75]范围内。\n\n      cliff sharpness(embedding 0.95, Min-K++ 0.92)量化了degradation的abruptness——\n      接近1.0意味着transition从high-AUC到near-chance发生在very narrow epoch window内。\n      这是\"cliff-like, not gradual\"claim的定量支撑。\n\n      signal×regime interaction highly significant(p<0.001)——不同signals在不同regimes\n      下的相对ranking发生了qualitative reversal(embedding在SFT下最强但在RL下最弱)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11: Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap\"\n        description: >\n          4 signals × 4 regimes矩阵。Heat-colored。Bottom row shows best-single and RRF composite per regime。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 8a: AUC heatmap (signal × regime)。Hot colors for SFT-contaminated, cold for RL。Clear block structure。\"\n      - \"Fig 8b: Signal degradation trajectory over RL training epochs。Embedding/Min-K++ show cliff at epoch 2-3, Self-Critique shows gradual mild decline。\"\n      - \"Fig 8c: Per-signal AUC violin plots grouped by regime。Demonstrates distribution shift from SFT to RL。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Signal survival是Core Contribution 2的foundation。cliff-like pattern有两个implications：\n      (1) for detection community——reports of \"RL breaks detection\" are confirmed but mechanism\n      is regime-specific(logit-based signals die, meta-cognitive signals survive)，\n      (2) for ContamCal——RRF must be regime-aware或at minimum include Self-Critique。\n      best档下Self-Critique的RL AUC=0.65(above 0.60 threshold)意味着ContamCal在RL regime\n      下仍functional，虽然CI appropriately wider(exp-005)。\n\n  - name: multi_family_validation\n    plan_id: exp-014\n    description: >\n      Llama-3.2-1B和Pythia-1.4B controlled SFT injection at 3 dosage levels(0%/25%/100%)，\n      验证cross-family generalization。\n    expected_results:\n      llama_mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp: 13.1\n      llama_calibration_mae_avg_pp: 1.7\n      llama_coverage_95_pct: 91\n      pythia_mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp: 12.6\n      pythia_calibration_mae_avg_pp: 1.8\n      pythia_coverage_95_pct: 90\n      multi_family_mae_gap_vs_qwen_pp: 0.3\n      llama_gamma_k_mmlu: 0.39\n      pythia_gamma_k_mmlu: 0.37\n      identifiability_boundary_consistent: true\n      cross_family_kendall_tau: 0.94\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下multi-family validation成功——Llama和Pythia的calibration精度与Qwen高度一致。\n      MAE gap仅0.3pp(well within best档[0.0, 1.0]范围)。\n\n      Llama-3.2-1B的inflation(13.1pp at 100%)略低于同scale Qwen(14.3pp at 100% for 0.5B-3B\n      avg)因为Llama的pre-training data composition不同，可能与benchmark的lexical overlap\n      patterns不同。但ContamCal的MAE(1.7pp)几乎identical因为IRT model captures\n      contamination通过item-level exposure mechanism——这个mechanism is architecture-agnostic。\n\n      Pythia-1.4B作为fundamentally不同的architecture family(GPT-NeoX based)提供了最强的\n      generalization evidence。inflation略低(12.6pp)和MAE略高(1.8pp)可能因为Pythia's\n      smaller pre-training corpus使base ability lower，contamination的relative effect\n      不同。但calibration仍effective——MAE 1.8pp在best档range内。\n\n      γ_k values(Llama 0.39, Pythia 0.37 for MMLU)vs Qwen(0.42)展示了family-dependent\n      contamination susceptibility，但都在same order of magnitude——ContamCal的γ_k\n      parametrization naturally accommodates this variation。\n\n      identifiability boundaries consistent across families：AUC threshold ~0.70对所有\n      three families成立，因为identifiability取决于signal quality和sample size，不取决于\n      model architecture。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 12: Multi-Family Calibration Comparison\"\n        description: >\n          Rows: Qwen2.5-1.5B, Llama-3.2-1B, Pythia-1.4B (matched scale)。\n          Columns: MAE, coverage, CI width, γ_k(MMLU), per benchmark。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 9: Cross-family MAE comparison bar chart with bootstrap CIs。Overlapping CIs demonstrate no significant family effect。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Multi-family validation回应reviewer concern #11。best档下Qwen/Llama/Pythia三族的\n      MAE CIs overlap(1.5±0.3, 1.7±0.4, 1.8±0.4)——no significant family effect。\n      这支持了ContamCal的generalizability claim：method不依赖于specific model family\n      的idiosyncratic properties。Pythia作为non-Transformer-derivative(虽然仍是transformer，\n      但不同design lineage)尤其有说服力。\n\n  - name: rl_observational_case_study\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      RL-trained models的observational case study：Qwen2.5-Instruct(0.5B-7B) + DeepSeek-R1-Distill。\n      Expected regret quantification + near-zero γ specificity test。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_instruct_3b_gamma_mmlu: 0.18\n      qwen_instruct_7b_gamma_mmlu: 0.22\n      deepseek_r1_7b_gamma_mmlu: 0.15\n      ci_width_rl_avg_pp: 7.8\n      coverage_95_rl_pct: 91\n      regret_uncalibrated_top5_pct: 40\n      regret_calibrated_top5_pct: 10\n      regret_remove_rescore_top5_pct: 25\n      near_zero_gamma_clean_benchmark: true\n      near_zero_gamma_value: 0.02\n      near_zero_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n      rl_calibrated_score_shift_avg_pp: 4.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下RL case study提供了convincing directional evidence。γ estimates for RL models\n      (0.15-0.22 for MMLU)低于SFT-only contaminated models(~0.42)——这合理因为(1) RL models\n      的contamination可能less severe(instruction tuning data不一定systematic include\n      benchmark paraphrases)，(2) RL partially masks contamination signal导致γ被\n      underestimated(wider CIs correctly reflect this uncertainty)。\n\n      CI width 7.8pp(vs SFT的3.1pp)——这是best档要求的ci_width_rl_pp [5.0, 10.0]范围。\n      RL regime的wider CIs是honest uncertainty，不是methodological failure。Coverage 91%\n      (using held-out clean benchmark as ground truth)表明CIs calibrated correctly even\n      in RL regime。\n\n      Expected regret analysis是practical motivation的定量展示：uncalibrated top-5 model\n      selection有40% regret(选错model因为contaminated scores mislead ranking)，\n      ContamCal calibrated selection降到10%，remove-rescore降到25%。ContamCal的优势来自\n      (1) 使用uncertainty-aware selection(high-uncertainty models deprioritized)，\n      (2) continuous exposure scores比binary flag更fine-grained。\n\n      near-zero γ check: 在known-clean benchmark(LiveBench recent items)上γ=0.02，\n      CI includes zero——specificity test PASS。ContamCal不在clean data上hallucinate\n      contamination。这回应了\"false positive\"concern。\n\n      ground truth for regret = held-out clean benchmark scores，NOT calibrated scores——\n      explicitly avoiding circularity(reviewer concern #12)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: RL Observational Case Study — γ Estimates with CIs\"\n        description: >\n          Rows: 6 RL models。Columns: γ_k per benchmark, 95% CI, CI width。\n      - name: \"Table 14: Expected Regret — Uncalibrated vs Calibrated vs Remove-Rescore\"\n        description: >\n          Top-K model selection regret at K=3,5,10 for 3 methods。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 10a: γ forest plot for RL models with wide CIs。Compared against SFT-contaminated γ (narrower, larger)。\"\n      - \"Fig 10b: Regret curve (K vs regret %) for 3 methods。ContamCal consistently lowest。\"\n      - \"Fig 10c: Near-zero γ check on clean benchmark — posterior concentrated around zero。\"\n    analysis: >\n      RL case study是external validity pillar。best档下directional results清晰：\n      contamination effects detected(γ>0 point estimates)but with appropriate uncertainty\n      (wide CIs)。regret analysis是论文practical motivation的最compelling evidence——\n      即使在RL regime下ContamCal仍提供better model selection。near-zero γ check的pass\n      是critical because it shows ContamCal不是systematically biased toward finding\n      contamination everywhere——it can correctly identify clean benchmarks。\n\n  - name: observational_72b\n    plan_id: exp-012\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-72B inference-only observational analysis。Extends ecological validity to frontier scale。\n    expected_results:\n      gamma_mmlu_72b: 0.25\n      gamma_mmlu_72b_ci: \"[0.08, 0.43]\"\n      ci_width_pp: 8.5\n      calibrated_mmlu_shift_pp: 5.8\n      signal_auc_self_critique_72b: 0.62\n      inference_cost_hours: 12\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下72B observational results directionally consistent with smaller scales。\n      γ(MMLU)=0.25 with wide CI [0.08, 0.43]——contamination detected但uncertainty large\n      因为(1) only 1 model at this scale(no population)，(2) 72B likely RL-trained导致\n      signal degradation。CI width 8.5pp reflects这些limitations。\n\n      calibrated MMLU score shift 5.8pp downward——如果true则meaningful(72B的reported MMLU\n      accuracy overestimated by ~6 points)。但wide CI means this could be as low as 2pp\n      or as high as 10pp。Self-Critique AUC=0.62(at identifiability boundary)——72B的\n      strong meta-cognition partially compensates for RL signal degradation。\n\n      这个result的价值是ecological validity at frontier scale，不是quantitative precision。\n      论文应frame为\"ContamCal suggests [X]pp overestimation with substantial uncertainty\"\n      而非precise claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 15: 72B Observational Results\"\n        description: >\n          Single-row summary: γ_k per benchmark, CIs, calibrated score shifts。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 11: 72B γ posterior density plot with 95% CI shaded。Wide but informative。\"\n    analysis: >\n      72B analysis回应reviewer concern #4(scale)。Combined with 7B controlled(exp-007)，\n      构成complete scale story from 0.5B to 72B。Key message：ContamCal scales to frontier\n      models but honest about uncertainty at N=1。\n\n  - name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n    plan_id: exp-013\n    description: >\n      ConStat + Self-Critique only(no logits/embeddings)的degraded mode calibration。\n    expected_results:\n      two_signal_rrf_auc_sft: 0.83\n      two_signal_calibration_mae_avg_pp: 2.4\n      two_signal_coverage_95_pct: 90\n      two_signal_ci_width_sft_pp: 4.8\n      mae_gap_vs_4signal_pp: 0.9\n      coverage_gap_vs_4signal_pp: 3\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下2-signal mode仍functional但degraded。MAE 2.4pp(vs 4-signal的1.5pp，\n      gap=0.9pp)——degradation meaningful但2-signal mode仍beats all baselines\n      (closest baseline DCR at 3.4pp)。Coverage 90%(vs 93%)——at the boundary of nominal\n      but still acceptable。CI width wider(4.8pp vs 3.1pp)because fewer signals means\n      more uncertainty in exposure estimation。\n\n      degradation来自two sources：(1) fewer signals means lower composite AUC(0.83 vs 0.92)，\n      (2) ConStat和Self-Critique are the two weaker signals in SFT regime。但它们是\n      closed-weight applicable signals，所以这个trade-off是practical necessity。\n\n      2-signal mode beats DCR(2.4 vs 3.4pp)说明即使在degraded mode下IRT-based approach\n      仍优于heuristic adjustment——IRT structure的value不完全来自signal quality。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 16: 4-Signal vs 2-Signal Mode Comparison\"\n        description: >\n          Side-by-side: MAE, coverage, CI width, Kendall τ for both modes across 4 benchmarks。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 12: Degradation waterfall chart showing MAE increase from 4-signal to 2-signal, decomposed by signal removal。\"\n    analysis: >\n      2-signal mode是practical extensibility result。best档下它仍beats all baselines，\n      meaning ContamCal applicable even to closed-weight models(GPT-4, Claude)where\n      only behavioral signals available。MAE gap(0.9pp)是quantified cost of closed-weight\n      constraint——practitioners can decide if this trade-off acceptable for their use case。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"bda79b13-dcb4-43f9-84c9-2136dd5f87f5","total_cost_usd":0.4476765,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12672,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":14193,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12672,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":14193,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12672,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12672},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":7631,"outputTokens":18,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0077209999999999996,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":14193,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":12672,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.4399555,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"6c94de40-3849-4f2a-8746-e9833fff57c0"}
